# SPA deep links: serve index.html for app routes. Explicit list (not a /*
// splat — the splat trips Workers' loop detector). `/` needs no rule
// (index.html serves directly). Unknown paths fall through to the
// platform 404; in-app bad routes still render the branded NotFound.
// Pages Functions are exempt from _redirects, so /api/contact is unaffected.
/about /index.html 200
/projects /index.html 200
/project/* /index.html 200
/archive /index.html 200
